- replace existing stucco cladding to rainscreen stucco cladding on the north and south elevations; 
- replace roof membrane and skylights;
- replace waterproofing assembly at patio on ground floor and balcony on 2nd-4th floor and install new tempered glass guardrails;
- replace all windows and sliding doors (same sizes) on all floors on the north and south side;

